  <div class="section-header">7. Practical Evaluation — Aerial Lift Operation</div>
  <div class="content-body">
    <p>Following the written assessment, Virgilio Espericueta completed a hands-on practical evaluation operating a MEC Micro19 scissor lift (Unit #19419, rented through EquipmentShare) at the active job site. The evaluation confirmed his ability to safely operate the equipment at elevation while wearing full fall protection, maintaining proper footing on the platform, and correctly connecting his lanyard to the designated anchor point inside the platform.</p>
    <p>All observed operations were performed in compliance with OSHA 29 CFR 1926.453 and the manufacturer's operating instructions. No safety violations or unsafe behaviors were observed during the practical evaluation.</p>
